    CONTROL "Cancel", 1008, "Button", 0x50010000, 212, 147, 58, 13, 0x00000000, 0
    CONTROL "Welcome to the hotkey creation wizard. This wizard will guide you through the process of creating your very own hotkeys and walk you through every step of the process in detail.", 1009, "Static", 0x50000000, 10, 16, 318, 24, 0x00000000, 0
    CONTROL "To start off, two hotkey types are offered to you. The first type works just like you would imagine a regular hotkey to work : it executes a certain command when you press it, but it also keeps executing it repeatedly as it is held down.", 1010, "Static", 0x50000000, 10, 36, 316, 24, 0x00000000, 0
END

